## 3. Coexistence Strategy

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Shared Layer"
        User
        SyncedStudent
        SyncedTeacher
        SyncedSubject
        AcademicYear
        Exam
        AuditLog
    end

    subgraph "Grade 1–5 Path"
        GradeConfig --> GradeScale
        EvaluationTemplate --> StudentEvaluationResult
        SubjectResult --> FinalResult --> Marksheet
    end

    subgraph "Grade 6–10 Path"
        SecondaryGradeScale
        SecondarySubjectConfig --> SecondarySubjectComponent
        SecondarySubjectComponent --> SecondaryPracticalHeading
        SecondaryComponentMark
        SecondarySubjectResult --> SecondaryTermResult
        SecondaryTermWeight
        SecondaryAnnualSubjectResult --> SecondaryAnnualResult
        SecondaryMarksheet
    end
```

**Routing**: `Exam.gradeLevel` determines which code path runs. Grade 1–5 API routes are untouched. All Secondary endpoints live under `/api/admin/secondary/` and `/api/teacher/secondary/`.

---

## 4. GPA / Grade Computation

### Per-Term (at compile time)

```
For each subject:
  total = IN + TH + PR(sum of heading marks)
  percentage = total / fullMarks × 100
  grade, gradePoint = lookup(SecondaryGradeScale, percentage)
  isNG = (grade == "NG")
  weightedPoint = creditHours × gradePoint

Term GPA = Σ(weightedPoint) / Σ(creditHours)
  - NG subjects: gradePoint = 0, but creditHours still in denominator
  - hasNG = true → resultStatus = NG_BLOCKED
```

### Annual (from term-weighted aggregation)

```
For each subject:
  annualObtained = Σ(term.totalObtained × termWeight%) for all terms
  annualFull     = Σ(term.totalFullMarks × termWeight%) for all terms
  percentage = annualObtained / annualFull × 100
  grade, GP = lookup(SecondaryGradeScale, percentage)

Annual GPA = Σ(creditHours × gradePoint) / Σ(creditHours)
```

### Pass Rule
- **Per-subject**: D (≥35%) minimum in each subject. No aggregate percentage.
- One NG in any subject → `NG_BLOCKED` regardless of overall GPA.

