## 5. API Surface

### New Endpoints

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| **Subject Config** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/subject-configs` | Create subject config (IN/TH/PR, credit hours) |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/subject-configs` | List configs by grade/year |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/secondary/subject-configs/:id` | Update config |
| **Practical Headings** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/components/:id/headings` | Add/update practical sub-headings |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/components/:id/headings` | List headings |
| **Term Weights** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/term-weights` | Configure term weight percentages (must sum to 100) |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/term-weights` | List term weights |
| **Mark Entry** |||
| `POST` | `/api/teacher/secondary/marks` | Enter IN/TH component marks |
| `POST` | `/api/teacher/secondary/practical-marks` | Enter practical heading marks (auto-sums to PR) |
| `POST` | `/api/teacher/secondary/marks/:id/submit` | Submit marks |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/marks/:id/verify` | Verify marks |
| **Term Compilation** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/exams/:examId/compile` | Compile term subject/final results |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/exams/:examId/publish` | Publish term results |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/exams/:examId/results` | Get term results |
| **Annual Compilation** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/annual/compile` | Compile annual results from term weights |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/annual/publish` | Publish annual results |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/annual/results` | Get annual results |
| **Marksheet** |||
| `POST` | `/api/admin/secondary/marksheets` | Generate term or annual marksheet |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/marksheets/:id` | Get marksheet |
| **Grade Scale** |||
| `GET` | `/api/admin/secondary/grade-scale` | Return fixed NEB grade table (read-only) |

### Changes to Existing
- `POST /api/admin/exams` — validation accepts "Grade 6"–"Grade 10"
- All other Grade 1–5 endpoints: **no changes**

---

## 6. Migration Plan — Phased Rollout

### Phase 1: Schema + Seed (Week 1)
- Add enums (`SecondaryComponentType`, `NG_BLOCKED`)
- Add all `Secondary*` models to [schema.prisma](file:///d:/school/result/svsresult/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Add relation fields to shared models
- `prisma migrate dev` + seed `SecondaryGradeScale`
- Create `src/lib/secondary-grades.ts` lookup utility

### Phase 2: Subject / Component Config (Week 2)
- Subject config CRUD APIs
- Practical heading CRUD APIs
- Term weight configuration API
- Admin UI: `/admin/secondary/subject-config`

### Phase 3: Teacher Mark Entry (Week 3)
- Component mark entry APIs (IN, TH direct; PR via heading marks → auto-sum)
- Submit/verify flow
- Teacher UI: `/teacher/secondary/mark-entry`

### Phase 4: Compilation Engine (Week 4)
- Term compile: components → subject percentage → grade lookup → GPA
- Annual compile: term weights → weighted aggregation → annual grade → annual GPA
- Admin UI: `/admin/secondary/result-compilation`

### Phase 5: Marksheet / PDF (Week 5)
- CDC-format template (components, headings, grade, GPA, credit hours)
- Term & annual marksheet generation
- NG visual flagging in PDF

### Phase 6: Admin UI Polish (Week 6)
- Dashboard integration with secondary stats
- Teacher secondary compilation view
- Reports and analytics

---

## 7. Open Questions

| # | Question | Default Assumption |
|---|---------|-------------------|
| 1 | **Term weights**: What are the exact percentages per term? (e.g. First 10%, Second 15%, Third 20%, Final 55%) | Admin configurable per grade/year — must sum to 100% |
| 2 | **50/50 split subjects**: Any subjects using 50 TH / 50 PR instead of 25/25/75? | No, but schema supports any split |
| 3 | **Term names/count**: Exactly "First Term, Second Term, Third Term, Final Term"? | Yes, 4 terms |
| 4 | **Grade 10 / SEE**: Any special handling for board exams? | Same flow as Grades 6–9 |

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated (Post-Implementation)
- `npx prisma validate` — schema syntax
- `npx prisma migrate dev --create-only` — valid SQL
- Seed test: 8 rows in `SecondaryGradeScale`
- Unit tests for GPA computation (all A+, one NG, D-threshold, credit-hour weighting, annual term-weighted aggregation)

### Manual
- Configure subject IN(25)/TH(75)/PR(25) with practical headings → verify credit hours auto-calc
- Enter heading marks → verify auto-sum to PR component
- Term compile → verify grades, GPA, NG flags, rank
- Configure term weights → compile annual → verify weighted aggregation
- Generate marksheet → verify CDC format, NG highlighting
